WEBVTT

01:24.880 --> 01:27.080
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:34.200 --> 01:35.440
It's beautiful.

01:35.520 --> 01:36.880
-Everyone will be impressed.
-Yeah.

01:36.960 --> 01:38.240
Xue.

01:39.440 --> 01:42.240
CLEAR MIND

01:44.760 --> 01:46.560
Today is the opening day of Clear Mind.

01:46.640 --> 01:47.720
Lady Bai,

01:47.800 --> 01:50.240
are you here to congratulate Ms. Su?

01:53.040 --> 01:54.240
I forgot.

01:54.840 --> 01:57.760
Did you get kicked
out of Zhenlang Pavilion?

02:00.000 --> 02:01.080
Xue.

02:01.160 --> 02:03.520
Did you pay your respects to Lady Yu?

02:04.120 --> 02:05.480
We don't have to do that.

02:05.560 --> 02:08.160
We are all shareholders of Clear Mind.

02:09.600 --> 02:12.080
With your money,

02:12.160 --> 02:15.200
Clear Mind shouldn't be running for long.

02:15.280 --> 02:16.240
Nonsense.

02:17.240 --> 02:18.640
I'm telling you.

02:18.720 --> 02:20.320
One of our shareholders

02:21.400 --> 02:22.600
is a Zheng.

02:25.200 --> 02:27.120
Forget it.

02:27.200 --> 02:28.440
Let's go.

02:34.920 --> 02:37.200
Clear Mind's stuff is beautiful.

02:37.280 --> 02:38.920
Yeah. Let's come here again tomorrow.

02:39.640 --> 02:40.800
This hairpin is delicate.

02:42.360 --> 02:43.360
Master.

02:43.440 --> 02:46.120
How can people be so shameless?

02:47.320 --> 02:48.840
Bai Niao came here

02:49.400 --> 02:50.320
and wanted to see you.

02:52.160 --> 02:53.560
I mocked her.

03:01.680 --> 03:03.600
Today is the opening day of Clear Mind
across the street.

03:03.680 --> 03:07.160
The street is crowded.

03:07.240 --> 03:09.440
The shop is busy.

03:10.560 --> 03:12.800
It makes our shop very deserted.

03:14.120 --> 03:15.000
How do we do business?

03:15.080 --> 03:16.760
How can they do business like that?

03:16.840 --> 03:19.840
Master, don't worry.
I'll smash their shop.

03:23.440 --> 03:24.280
What's wrong with you?

03:24.920 --> 03:26.600
Their business has nothing to do with us.

03:26.680 --> 03:28.600
If you are free, count our inventory

03:28.680 --> 03:29.640
and settle the accounts.

03:29.720 --> 03:31.640
This table is dirty. Clean it.

03:31.720 --> 03:33.880
You never cared about that.

03:33.960 --> 03:35.120
Master.

03:35.200 --> 03:36.360
Do you feel like

03:36.440 --> 03:38.240
you're facing a great enemy?

03:39.440 --> 03:40.720
Facing a great enemy?

03:42.080 --> 03:43.480
Nonsense.

03:45.040 --> 03:48.640
People who buy ten-cashes jewelry
are not our target customers.

03:48.720 --> 03:50.600
Of course.
The shop that sells ten-cashes jewelry

03:50.680 --> 03:51.680
is not our opponent.

03:53.080 --> 03:55.560
What are you talking about?
Master, good for you.

03:59.400 --> 04:00.600
By the way,

04:00.680 --> 04:03.320
Zhang Jinran

04:03.400 --> 04:04.440
will come to Yangzhou soon.

04:05.840 --> 04:07.840
He was appointed
as Inspector of Huainandao.

04:07.920 --> 04:10.640
When he arrives, he will be good for us

04:11.560 --> 04:13.760
and for Clear Mind.

04:13.840 --> 04:15.480
Should we give him some clues?

04:16.880 --> 04:18.480
He should know what to do.

04:19.079 --> 04:22.000
He used to be a scholar.

04:22.600 --> 04:25.440
Now, he's a high-ranking official
with real power.

04:25.960 --> 04:27.480
After all, he's still Zhang Jinran.

04:40.560 --> 04:43.320
ZHENLANG PAVILION

04:43.400 --> 04:48.200
CLEAR MIND

04:56.760 --> 05:02.760
ZHENLANG PAVILION

05:04.480 --> 05:05.520
Do you have wine?

05:09.320 --> 05:11.440
No. I only have tea.

05:11.520 --> 05:13.240
Tea is good for you.

05:13.320 --> 05:14.440
It can make you sober.

05:15.760 --> 05:17.360
It's mine.

05:17.440 --> 05:18.760
It's not yours.

05:18.840 --> 05:19.680
I took a fancy to it first.

05:19.760 --> 05:21.080
Did you pay for it?

05:21.160 --> 05:22.120
I can pay right away.

05:24.120 --> 05:27.160
Your opening day looks lively.

05:27.240 --> 05:28.840
But it's not good for your business.

05:29.760 --> 05:31.240
Most of your customers

05:31.320 --> 05:32.680
are the common people.

05:32.760 --> 05:35.480
If Clear Mind gives people
the impression of being cheap,

05:35.560 --> 05:37.280
the rich and noble families
will give it up.

05:37.880 --> 05:40.400
You should know
that jewelry is not just about beauty.

05:40.480 --> 05:42.560
It's a symbol of status.

05:44.200 --> 05:45.040
You're right.

05:45.640 --> 05:48.760
Zhenlang Pavilion, Jubao House,

05:48.840 --> 05:51.440
Baicaojing House, and Zhenbao House

05:51.520 --> 05:53.640
are symbols of status.

05:55.520 --> 05:56.720
If I want

05:57.520 --> 06:00.440
to stand out among these jewelry shops,

06:02.480 --> 06:04.680
I have to rely on these common ladies.

06:05.280 --> 06:08.120
Clear Mind can please them.

06:08.960 --> 06:10.400
They can also please me.

06:14.840 --> 06:15.720
You have a point.

06:16.800 --> 06:17.920
You have an idea.

06:19.480 --> 06:21.200
We came to Yangzhou together.

06:21.880 --> 06:23.320
But in such a short time,

06:24.400 --> 06:26.720
you opened a big shop
opposite Zhenlang Pavilion.

06:27.400 --> 06:28.800
And you're fighting with Yan Zijing.

06:29.640 --> 06:31.840
Forget about my advice.

06:31.920 --> 06:33.200
I underestimated you.

06:33.800 --> 06:34.920
Thankfully,

06:36.080 --> 06:37.880
we are both targeting Yan Zijing.

06:40.160 --> 06:41.360
Yes.

06:42.080 --> 06:43.600
If it weren't for Yan Zijing,

06:44.120 --> 06:46.080
I wouldn't have opened Clear Mind.

06:51.520 --> 06:52.920
But we are different.

06:55.280 --> 06:56.840
Clear Mind is my business,

06:58.280 --> 06:59.320
not my sword.

07:05.200 --> 07:07.080
Have you forgotten your blood feud?

07:07.920 --> 07:09.600
Have you forgotten Shrimp

07:09.680 --> 07:11.480
and the dead of the trading convoy?

07:11.560 --> 07:14.240
They are waiting for you to avenge them.

07:18.880 --> 07:20.440
That's why

07:22.560 --> 07:23.840
I said

07:26.160 --> 07:27.400
we are different.

07:38.320 --> 07:40.120
Huan.

07:40.200 --> 07:42.120
I brought you jewelry.

07:42.680 --> 07:44.480
It's yours.

07:46.520 --> 07:48.320
You won the top beauty title.

07:48.400 --> 07:50.080
You can't retire.

07:50.640 --> 07:52.960
It's a waste of your good years.

07:57.160 --> 07:59.480
I know you're mad at me.

08:00.240 --> 08:02.800
You know how the Huan family is.

08:03.760 --> 08:05.320
You won the top beauty title.

08:05.400 --> 08:06.760
We'll make a difference.

08:07.280 --> 08:10.760
In the future,
the Huan family will support you

08:10.840 --> 08:12.640
at any cost.

08:14.200 --> 08:15.400
It wasn't easy raising you

08:15.480 --> 08:17.360
all these years.

08:17.960 --> 08:19.160
When you were a baby,

08:19.240 --> 08:22.160
I picked you up from the snow.

08:22.240 --> 08:24.200
-You can't be--
-Ungrateful?

08:29.200 --> 08:30.440
Did the Huan family do anything

08:30.520 --> 08:31.920
to support me in winning
the top beauty title?

08:33.640 --> 08:35.159
As for you raising me,

08:35.760 --> 08:38.000
I've paid you back with all the money

08:38.600 --> 08:40.039
I've made you over the years.

08:41.280 --> 08:42.559
The jewelry

08:43.080 --> 08:44.320
was mine.

08:46.760 --> 08:48.160
Mr. Huan, please leave.

08:48.240 --> 08:49.920
From now on, I have nothing to do

08:50.680 --> 08:51.640
with the Huan family.

08:51.720 --> 08:54.640
Huan, do you want to leave
the Huan family?

08:55.240 --> 08:56.360
Please leave.

09:02.120 --> 09:03.120
Do you think

09:03.800 --> 09:06.120
Clear Mind can be your support?

09:06.920 --> 09:07.800
Dream on.

09:09.080 --> 09:10.200
It won't take long for you

09:10.920 --> 09:12.560
to come back crying and begging me.

09:39.800 --> 09:41.840
Zhenlang Pavilion's jewelry

09:41.920 --> 09:42.840
is gorgeous.

09:43.560 --> 09:45.560
Mr. Yan, you're from the Western Regions.

09:45.640 --> 09:46.840
You must know where to buy it.

09:46.920 --> 09:48.160
I do.

09:49.120 --> 09:53.760
If the Western Regions colored stones
sell well in Yangzhou,

09:54.280 --> 09:56.640
would you like to sell them?

10:00.560 --> 10:01.720
Of course.

10:01.800 --> 10:04.520
Mr. Yan, we're counting on you.

10:06.240 --> 10:08.080
Mr. Yan, you're generous.

10:10.880 --> 10:12.440
Jades are fine and simple.

10:13.160 --> 10:15.360
Pearls are elegant and noble.

10:15.440 --> 10:17.200
Golds are brilliant and magnificent.

10:17.280 --> 10:19.560
Western Regions colored stones
are colorful.

10:20.840 --> 10:22.280
But they are kitsch.

10:22.800 --> 10:26.160
They are no match
for Central Plains jewelry.

10:31.920 --> 10:33.080
Mr. Zheng, you're right.

10:34.520 --> 10:35.880
Have you heard

10:35.960 --> 10:37.560
that Su Muzhe

10:37.640 --> 10:38.600
opened a shop?

10:39.400 --> 10:40.840
It's called Clear Mind, right?

10:42.600 --> 10:44.840
It's inappropriate for a woman
to open a shop.

10:45.440 --> 10:47.320
It's a disgrace to the jewelry industry.

10:47.400 --> 10:48.680
Anyway, she opened the shop.

10:48.760 --> 10:50.000
And she's doing great.

10:50.680 --> 10:52.040
Her customers lined up

10:52.120 --> 10:53.560
all the way to my stop this morning.

10:54.280 --> 10:56.760
Maybe she has a skill.

10:56.840 --> 10:57.840
Mr. Zheng.

10:57.920 --> 11:00.760
A woman opened a shop in Yangzhou.

11:00.840 --> 11:02.520
But she didn't inform us.

11:02.600 --> 11:04.520
I don't think it's appropriate.

11:04.600 --> 11:05.840
In my opinion,

11:05.920 --> 11:09.040
we should cut off her gold and raw stones.

11:09.120 --> 11:11.600
Let's see what she can do.

11:11.680 --> 11:12.720
Yeah.

11:12.800 --> 11:14.600
-You have a point.
-Yeah.

11:24.520 --> 11:26.920
Clear Mind's shareholders are Zheng Wu

11:27.000 --> 11:28.880
and some songstresses.

11:28.960 --> 11:30.840
They can't resist the suppression
of the jewelry guild.

11:31.480 --> 11:33.240
When she opened her shop here,

11:33.320 --> 11:34.440
she should have thought about that.

11:35.920 --> 11:37.200
Are you going to help her?

11:37.280 --> 11:38.840
I won't help her this time.

11:39.880 --> 11:40.920
She doesn't want me to help.

11:42.720 --> 11:44.320
If she wants to get a foothold here,

11:44.960 --> 11:46.800
she has to go through this.

11:46.880 --> 11:48.240
So she can grow.

11:50.480 --> 11:51.400
Let's get to business.

11:52.720 --> 11:54.720
The Black Dragon Bandits
have been dormant since the last time.

11:55.400 --> 11:57.720
They robbed once last month.

11:57.800 --> 11:59.160
We haven't found

11:59.240 --> 12:00.400
their base yet.

12:00.480 --> 12:02.240
They will sell

12:02.320 --> 12:03.360
what they robbed.

12:04.160 --> 12:06.960
Only the Zheng family
can help them sell their robbed goods.

12:07.560 --> 12:08.560
What are we going to do?

12:09.160 --> 12:10.440
I heard that Prince Ying

12:10.960 --> 12:14.080
ordered a birthday gift
for the Empress Dowager at Jubao House.

12:21.360 --> 12:23.400
Have you found the escorts?

12:24.480 --> 12:25.680
Yes, Master.

12:25.760 --> 12:27.200
I found the best escorts.

12:30.160 --> 12:32.120
You must be cautious.

12:32.200 --> 12:34.440
Send the Red Leaf Crown
to Chang'an safely.

12:35.640 --> 12:36.560
Yes.

12:40.480 --> 12:43.200
Master, Hexi got some goods.

12:43.280 --> 12:44.960
They informed us to pick it up.

12:50.640 --> 12:53.440
Prince Ying told us not to trade recently.

12:53.520 --> 12:55.120
Why did they ignore it?

12:55.720 --> 12:57.280
What should we do?

12:57.360 --> 12:58.920
The cargo ship
is about to arrive in Yangzhou.

12:59.000 --> 13:00.400
If we don't pick it up,

13:01.000 --> 13:02.560
it would be more dangerous.

13:05.640 --> 13:06.960
Those goods

13:08.800 --> 13:10.000
are dangerous.

14:04.160 --> 14:06.240
Why didn't you just play the pipa?

14:06.920 --> 14:08.960
Why did you follow Clear Mind
and change your plan?

14:09.040 --> 14:10.120
You lost the top beauty title.

14:10.200 --> 14:12.680
Do you know how much it affects
Baicaojing House's business?

14:12.760 --> 14:14.960
Mr. Qin, ease up.

14:15.040 --> 14:16.120
Shut up.

14:17.160 --> 14:19.080
Are you upset?

14:19.160 --> 14:21.160
Okay, I won't blame you.

14:21.240 --> 14:23.200
If you go to your patron,
won't he blame you?

14:25.800 --> 14:26.720
What's wrong?

14:26.800 --> 14:28.120
He didn't see you?

14:30.920 --> 14:32.640
You ended up losing everything.

14:32.720 --> 14:33.880
We can't rely on the Zheng family.

14:33.960 --> 14:35.240
The patron doesn't want to see you.

14:35.320 --> 14:36.760
Even Zhenlang Pavilion
doesn't invest in you.

14:36.840 --> 14:38.040
What should we do?

14:38.120 --> 14:39.320
Don't forget

14:39.400 --> 14:41.680
that I opened Baicaojing House for you.

14:41.760 --> 14:43.240
Watch your attitude.

14:47.360 --> 14:48.840
You're like my own sister.

14:50.680 --> 14:52.120
You should support me.

14:57.840 --> 15:02.680
GRACIOUS COURTYARD OF ORCHIDS AND JADE

15:04.280 --> 15:05.200
Let me see.

15:06.040 --> 15:07.040
Let me see.

15:08.440 --> 15:09.560
Does it still hurt?

15:11.840 --> 15:12.760
Be careful.

15:12.840 --> 15:15.560
Ask Xuanji to help you with your work.

15:15.640 --> 15:18.400
Tomorrow, I'll get you a good doctor
to change the dressing.

15:18.480 --> 15:19.960
You'll be able to play the pipa again
in a few days.

15:21.400 --> 15:22.720
As long as you can play the pipa,

15:23.400 --> 15:26.000
Baicaojing House's business
will get better and better.

15:28.440 --> 15:29.600
Don't be upset.

15:29.680 --> 15:31.400
I didn't mean it.

15:31.920 --> 15:33.160
I'm doing it for your own good.

15:33.240 --> 15:34.680
You're like my own sister.

15:34.760 --> 15:37.160
I love you.

15:37.240 --> 15:38.680
As long as you're good,

15:38.760 --> 15:40.080
Baicaojing House will be good.

15:43.080 --> 15:44.600
Speaking of business,

15:44.680 --> 15:46.840
Niao, I need more money.

15:47.880 --> 15:49.040
Why are you asking me for money again?

15:49.120 --> 15:50.760
I just gave you money.

15:52.440 --> 15:55.600
Mu, spend more time on business.

15:55.680 --> 15:56.640
If you have time,

15:56.720 --> 15:58.520
go to Clear Mind

15:58.600 --> 16:00.560
and look at their designs.

16:00.640 --> 16:03.000
Hire some skilled craftsmen.

16:03.600 --> 16:06.240
Baicaojing House's jewelry

16:06.320 --> 16:07.480
is out of date.

16:07.560 --> 16:09.600
You have a point, Niao.

16:09.680 --> 16:12.360
That's why I need new designs
and new goods.

16:13.000 --> 16:15.000
Do you think I'm asking you for money
for yourself?

16:15.080 --> 16:16.400
It's for business.

16:17.360 --> 16:20.120
Give me some money. I can make more money.

16:23.760 --> 16:24.840
Go.

16:28.600 --> 16:29.960
Don't worry, Niao.

16:30.680 --> 16:32.440
I have a plan.

16:32.520 --> 16:33.880
About the new goods…

16:41.760 --> 16:42.760
What are you thinking about?

16:43.560 --> 16:44.440
I'm telling you.

16:45.040 --> 16:46.760
One of our shareholders

16:47.720 --> 16:48.920
is a Zheng.

16:52.680 --> 16:53.520
Who are you trying to set up?

16:56.440 --> 16:59.320
Think of a way to tell the Zheng family

17:00.000 --> 17:02.840
that Zheng Wu invested in Clear Mind
behind their back.

17:03.760 --> 17:07.359
He supported Lady Huan
at the Qionghua Festival.

17:07.960 --> 17:09.560
I knew Zheng Wu had money.

17:09.640 --> 17:12.119
If you hooked him, the top beauty title…

17:13.640 --> 17:15.880
I'll shut up. Don't be mad.

17:15.960 --> 17:17.119
I'll do what you say.

17:28.960 --> 17:30.080
Master.

17:40.000 --> 17:41.640
Turn around.

18:19.400 --> 18:20.720
Hero. Please spare my life.

18:20.800 --> 18:22.960
-Don't move.
-Please spare my life. You…

18:23.040 --> 18:24.840
I'll give you as much as you want.

18:24.920 --> 18:26.920
Don't take that.

18:27.000 --> 18:30.200
I'll be beheaded.

18:37.560 --> 18:40.880
Please don't.

18:41.480 --> 18:42.560
No.

18:46.360 --> 18:47.400
Um…

18:49.400 --> 18:50.400
Are you saying

18:51.240 --> 18:53.280
that they didn't want to take it away?

18:54.360 --> 18:55.760
Yes.

18:55.840 --> 18:58.960
They smashed the Red Lead Crown

18:59.040 --> 19:00.200
and left.

19:00.800 --> 19:03.600
They wanted to ruin my big thing.

19:03.680 --> 19:05.120
It's a birthday gift
for the Empress Dowager.

19:06.240 --> 19:07.720
It's trash now.

19:08.600 --> 19:10.240
Master…

19:10.760 --> 19:12.040
Master.

19:13.560 --> 19:14.880
How many people know about this?

19:14.960 --> 19:17.840
Only the escorts and me.

19:18.440 --> 19:19.280
Don't

19:19.360 --> 19:21.160
get the word out.

19:21.240 --> 19:23.120
Get the best craftsmen

19:23.200 --> 19:25.720
and remake it as soon as possible.

19:25.800 --> 19:29.280
Master. These red leaves
are the finest rubies from Tazi.

19:29.360 --> 19:31.400
Jubao House used all rubies on it.

19:31.480 --> 19:33.160
We're out of stock.

19:34.520 --> 19:35.480
What?

19:36.400 --> 19:37.520
We're out of stock.

19:39.440 --> 19:40.480
Then, go buy it.

19:40.560 --> 19:41.760
If Prince Ying gets angry,

19:41.840 --> 19:43.240
the Zheng family can't afford it.

19:43.320 --> 19:46.080
These rubies are rare in Yangzhou.

19:46.160 --> 19:49.120
Due to the rampant bandits in Hexi,
there are few merchants.

19:49.200 --> 19:51.440
I'm afraid only Zhenlang Pavilion has them

19:51.520 --> 19:54.120
in Yangzhou.

19:55.880 --> 19:57.120
Zhenlang Pavilion.

19:57.200 --> 19:59.640
Western Regions colored stones
are colorful.

19:59.720 --> 20:01.680
But they are kitsch.

20:01.760 --> 20:05.000
They are no match
for Central Plains jewelry.

20:06.040 --> 20:07.080
Mr. Zheng, you're right.

20:09.480 --> 20:10.600
Go there.

20:10.680 --> 20:12.840
Whatever his conditions, promise him.

20:12.920 --> 20:15.320
-Yes, Master. Yes, Master.
-Go.

20:29.720 --> 20:31.240
What can I do for you?

20:31.760 --> 20:33.200
What can you do for me?

20:33.280 --> 20:36.120
I'm here to smash your shop. Get away.

20:39.840 --> 20:41.320
I'll kill myself if you smash my shop.

20:43.240 --> 20:44.800
Drop your hairpin.

20:44.880 --> 20:47.080
I'm telling you. I don't care if you die.

20:48.400 --> 20:49.400
Do you think I don't dare?

20:51.440 --> 20:52.440
Shou.

20:52.960 --> 20:55.320
Go out and close the door.

20:56.040 --> 21:00.480
I'll play with her.

21:00.560 --> 21:01.840
Okay.

21:06.560 --> 21:08.880
I'll give you one last chance.

21:10.480 --> 21:11.520
Drop your hairpin.

21:16.760 --> 21:18.560
Let's talk about it. Here's the thing.

21:20.240 --> 21:23.440
I was asked to do this.
I took the money to smash your shop.

21:23.520 --> 21:26.200
If I don't smash it,
I'll lose my credit and my face.

21:26.280 --> 21:28.160
And someone else
will mess with you. Right?

21:28.240 --> 21:31.160
How about this? You pick

21:31.240 --> 21:32.760
some of the cheapest jewelry.

21:32.840 --> 21:34.280
Put away all the valuable jewelry.

21:34.360 --> 21:35.560
Leave me with some cheap

21:35.640 --> 21:38.040
and fragile jewelry.
So, I can take the money and look good.

21:38.120 --> 21:40.640
You won't have big losses.
What do you say?

21:41.400 --> 21:43.920
I'll close my eyes. I won't see it.

21:44.000 --> 21:45.080
Okay?

21:45.840 --> 21:47.000
Really?

21:47.080 --> 21:48.120
Absolutely.

21:54.600 --> 21:55.600
Don't move.

21:56.280 --> 21:57.400
I didn't move.

22:16.640 --> 22:18.440
Duanwu worked hard to get everything here.

22:18.520 --> 22:19.680
I understand.

22:19.760 --> 22:21.720
If you want to smash things,
smash this one.

22:25.280 --> 22:28.200
-This?
-Will you smash it?

22:32.120 --> 22:34.080
Miss, I…

22:34.600 --> 22:37.720
I am the number one martial arts master
in the world.

22:37.800 --> 22:39.280
I'm a man. Right?

22:39.360 --> 22:40.480
I need respect.

22:40.560 --> 22:43.080
You want me to smash this. How about this?

22:43.760 --> 22:46.560
You pick something

22:46.640 --> 22:49.560
that is a little more expensive than it.

22:49.640 --> 22:52.560
I'll smash that. I'll make some noise.
So I can report it to my employer.

22:52.640 --> 22:54.280
You won't have big losses.

22:55.120 --> 22:56.120
Think about it.

23:00.040 --> 23:01.640
Stay safe.

23:01.720 --> 23:05.040
ZHENLANG PAVILION

23:07.520 --> 23:09.240
Steward Zheng.

23:13.640 --> 23:14.640
What's wrong…?

23:14.720 --> 23:16.480
It's not a big deal.

23:18.640 --> 23:21.200
Steward Zheng, what brings you here?

23:21.280 --> 23:24.200
I want to talk to Mr. Yan
about a big deal.

23:26.360 --> 23:27.360
Unfortunately,

23:27.440 --> 23:29.080
Mr. Yan is not here.

23:30.640 --> 23:33.440
If you want to talk about business,

23:33.520 --> 23:34.640
you can talk to me.

23:34.720 --> 23:36.120
Can you call the shots?

23:37.480 --> 23:38.760
Of course.

23:39.520 --> 23:42.080
Steward Zhao, let's talk in private.

23:42.680 --> 23:43.680
Please.

23:49.240 --> 23:51.920
I want 30 top-notch rubies.

23:55.080 --> 23:58.080
Steward Zheng,
you came to the right person.

23:58.160 --> 24:00.680
I can tell you that
only Zhenlang Pavilion has them

24:00.760 --> 24:02.240
in Yangzhou.

24:03.760 --> 24:06.760
But they are expensive.

24:08.240 --> 24:09.400
One million cash.

24:11.680 --> 24:14.480
Steward Zheng, you must be kidding.

24:15.760 --> 24:17.080
Seventy million cash.

24:20.120 --> 24:22.440
Good things are expensive.

24:22.520 --> 24:24.840
Since you cannot decide,

24:25.480 --> 24:26.640
you can consider it.

24:27.680 --> 24:30.160
In that case, I'll leave.

24:31.160 --> 24:32.280
Take care.

24:34.680 --> 24:36.800
-Are you going to keep the store open?
-What's wrong?

24:36.880 --> 24:38.240
-Huh?
-What happened?

24:39.080 --> 24:40.400
Close your shop.

24:41.120 --> 24:43.800
A woman wants to open a shop.

24:43.880 --> 24:45.080
What's this?

24:45.160 --> 24:46.000
CLEAR MIND

24:46.080 --> 24:48.080
-They should learn some lessons.
-What is this?

24:48.160 --> 24:50.520
A woman opening a shop is an insult

24:50.600 --> 24:51.840
to the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild.

24:51.920 --> 24:53.000
Steward Zheng.

24:53.520 --> 24:55.080
ZHENLANG PAVILION

24:55.160 --> 24:56.440
Mr. Qin.

24:58.440 --> 24:59.280
How are you!

24:59.360 --> 25:02.400
I heard that Zheng Wu
is a shareholder of Zhenlang Pavilion.

25:02.480 --> 25:04.200
-A woman wants to open a shop.
-He put in a lot of effort

25:04.280 --> 25:06.240
to support Lady Huan
at the Qionghua Festival.

25:06.320 --> 25:08.040
Did they mess with rogues?

25:08.120 --> 25:09.560
Ridiculous.

25:09.640 --> 25:11.040
Parents are always in control
of the family property.

25:11.120 --> 25:12.800
The Zheng family
will not invest in others.

25:12.880 --> 25:15.040
He won't secretly support Clear Mind.

25:16.400 --> 25:17.720
I'll tell my master about it.

25:18.320 --> 25:20.680
We'll expose the Su's scams.

25:23.680 --> 25:24.920
He's smashing hard.

25:28.480 --> 25:30.400
Thank you, sir. Sir.

25:30.480 --> 25:31.600
I have a question.

25:31.680 --> 25:34.200
You're the owner of Baicaojing House.

25:34.280 --> 25:36.800
Why are you picking on a little shop
that just opened?

25:37.680 --> 25:38.840
Mind your business.

25:38.920 --> 25:40.160
Don't poke around.

25:41.880 --> 25:43.160
Animal.

25:43.920 --> 25:45.800
There are some shops
on the east side of the city.

25:45.880 --> 25:47.200
I'll go there tomorrow.

25:47.920 --> 25:49.640
Remember. Buy something.

25:49.720 --> 25:50.760
Okay, ma'ma.

25:51.400 --> 25:52.320
Duanwu.

25:52.400 --> 25:54.000
-What happened?
-Yunxiu.

25:54.080 --> 25:55.000
It's okay.

25:55.080 --> 25:57.320
Duanwu, it's fake. It's okay.

25:57.400 --> 25:58.480
What about our jewelry?

25:58.560 --> 26:00.680
Don't worry, Duanwu.
I put the jewelry away.

26:01.280 --> 26:03.200
You went to buy gold and raw stones.
How's it going?

26:03.280 --> 26:05.640
All the shops changed their minds.

26:05.720 --> 26:09.000
Other shops refused to sell to us
as they knew we were from Clear Mind.

26:09.080 --> 26:10.600
We must have been targeted.

26:12.360 --> 26:13.680
What should we do?

26:15.960 --> 26:16.800
Don't worry.

26:17.840 --> 26:18.680
Let's clean it up first.

26:19.280 --> 26:20.680
-Close the shop, Yingtao.
-Okay.

26:22.080 --> 26:22.920
Ms. Su.

26:25.360 --> 26:27.920
Have you encountered
any difficulties recently?

26:35.520 --> 26:37.320
The decoration here

26:37.880 --> 26:40.960
is special.

26:42.160 --> 26:43.120
Garuda.

26:43.200 --> 26:45.800
Learn from Ms. Su.

26:45.880 --> 26:47.200
She doesn't follow the usual path.

26:47.280 --> 26:50.160
Mr. Zheng, what brings you here?

26:50.240 --> 26:51.240
I'm sorry you had to see this.

26:53.520 --> 26:56.800
You opened your shop
opposite Zhenlang Pavilion.

26:57.600 --> 26:59.960
You came up with the idea
of making jewelry out of shell shards.

27:01.320 --> 27:02.520
Looks like you lost money.

27:02.600 --> 27:04.480
But you became popular quickly.

27:04.560 --> 27:06.120
You're smart.

27:08.320 --> 27:12.080
I heard that the jewelry shops
are going to join forces

27:12.600 --> 27:14.080
to cut off your supply chain.

27:15.760 --> 27:19.560
As a shareholder, I'm worried.

27:19.640 --> 27:21.480
Mr. Zheng, don't worry.

27:23.480 --> 27:24.840
Clear Mind

27:26.440 --> 27:28.360
-will think of a way.
-How?

27:30.840 --> 27:32.920
You have no advantage in gold
or raw stones.

27:33.000 --> 27:34.680
Now, you're suppressed.

27:34.760 --> 27:36.720
Ms. Su.

27:36.800 --> 27:39.080
How many months can you pay your rent?

27:42.640 --> 27:44.240
I don't understand

27:46.000 --> 27:47.280
what you mean.

27:47.360 --> 27:48.640
Nothing.

27:48.720 --> 27:52.160
I thought about what you promised me.

27:52.240 --> 27:54.440
And now you're like this.

27:54.520 --> 27:55.920
I'm here to advise you.

27:56.000 --> 27:58.080
If you can't run the shop anymore,
close it before it's too late

27:58.160 --> 27:59.360
and give me back my money.

28:00.280 --> 28:01.720
I don't want to lose all my money.

28:01.800 --> 28:03.840
The jewelry guild
is suppressing my Clear Mind.

28:04.520 --> 28:06.640
As the largest shareholder,

28:06.720 --> 28:08.280
you should be helping me

28:09.080 --> 28:10.160
instead of mocking me.

28:10.240 --> 28:11.480
Su Muzhe.

28:11.560 --> 28:13.680
If you're not capable

28:13.760 --> 28:15.240
and depend on me for everything,

28:15.320 --> 28:17.040
why should you take 40% of the shares?

28:17.120 --> 28:19.840
Why are you standing here today?

28:23.080 --> 28:24.240
You're right.

28:27.080 --> 28:29.360
I finally opened Clear Mind.

28:30.600 --> 28:32.080
I don't want it to be like this.

28:34.000 --> 28:35.200
I'll think of a way.

28:36.160 --> 28:37.760
I don't have the patience for this.

28:37.840 --> 28:40.600
Give back my money.
It's five million cash with interest.

28:40.680 --> 28:42.960
I'll come to get the money later.

28:53.760 --> 28:54.720
Master.

28:55.240 --> 28:57.040
I didn't see Yan Zijing.

28:57.560 --> 28:59.640
Steward Zhao
asked for 70 million cash for it.

29:00.240 --> 29:01.400
I can't decide.

29:02.280 --> 29:05.160
I asked around at other shops.

29:05.240 --> 29:06.280
Some shops don't have it.

29:06.360 --> 29:08.920
Some are not good enough
for the Empress Dowager.

29:09.000 --> 29:12.400
Prince Ying has told the Empress Dowager
about the Red Leave Crown.

29:12.920 --> 29:15.240
We have to make it at any cost.

29:15.320 --> 29:18.240
We've spent a lot on the Red Leave Crown.

29:18.320 --> 29:20.160
We have financial difficulties…

29:23.360 --> 29:25.520
-Those goods…
-No.

29:28.400 --> 29:29.960
Prince Ying has warned us.

29:30.040 --> 29:31.600
He must have a reason.

29:31.680 --> 29:33.560
We shouldn't act recklessly.

29:34.280 --> 29:35.760
It's too late to change it

29:35.840 --> 29:37.400
like we used to.

29:38.160 --> 29:40.360
I'll talk to Yan Zijing.

29:40.440 --> 29:42.840
See if we can pay later.

29:42.920 --> 29:47.360
Master, I heard a rumor today.

29:48.520 --> 29:51.840
It's said that Zheng Wu
is a shareholder of Zhenlang Pavilion.

29:52.600 --> 29:55.480
He helped Lady Huan

29:55.560 --> 29:56.520
win the top beauty title
at the Qionghua Festival.

29:59.760 --> 30:01.280
I knew it.

30:01.920 --> 30:04.960
Clear Mind wouldn't have so much money.

30:05.720 --> 30:07.320
Zheng Wu is stupid.

30:07.400 --> 30:09.160
All he knows is to enjoy life.

30:09.240 --> 30:10.920
He doesn't understand business.

30:14.080 --> 30:16.400
He must have been deceived by that girl.

30:16.920 --> 30:18.560
Neither of my sons

30:18.640 --> 30:20.360
would give me a break.

30:27.800 --> 30:28.960
Mr. Zheng,

30:29.480 --> 30:31.000
it's an honor to have you here.

30:32.160 --> 30:33.320
Mr. Yan, I'm flattered.

30:35.360 --> 30:37.480
What brings you here?

30:39.120 --> 30:40.800
I urgently need some rubies.

30:41.640 --> 30:42.840
I asked around

30:43.600 --> 30:45.560
and came to you.

30:45.640 --> 30:47.400
We are in the same ship.

30:47.480 --> 30:48.920
If you help me today,

30:49.000 --> 30:50.360
I'll repay you later.

30:51.000 --> 30:52.440
Don't worry.

30:52.520 --> 30:54.440
I'll see you right.

30:57.280 --> 30:58.360
I'm sorry.

30:59.560 --> 31:00.960
I don't get it.

31:01.880 --> 31:03.920
You were not interested
in Western Regions colored stones

31:04.000 --> 31:06.080
at the guild meeting the other day.

31:06.600 --> 31:08.680
Why do you want so many rubies today?

31:13.480 --> 31:14.560
Mr. Yan.

31:15.800 --> 31:17.680
Do you want me to apologize to you?

31:20.480 --> 31:22.880
-No.
-Do me a favor.

31:23.400 --> 31:26.680
I'll pay you 50 million cash
in three months.

31:32.720 --> 31:33.960
Mr. Zheng, don't make fun of me.

31:35.000 --> 31:37.840
You know the industry rule.
Cash on delivery.

31:38.640 --> 31:41.320
You're the guild lead.
You won't break the rules, right?

31:43.320 --> 31:44.600
To be honest,

31:45.600 --> 31:46.840
someone booked my rubies.

31:47.880 --> 31:50.680
We have agreed on the price.
It's just that we didn't sign a contract.

31:51.520 --> 31:52.960
Who booked them?

32:00.000 --> 32:00.880
Forget it.

32:02.080 --> 32:04.320
Since you're here, I'll please you.

32:05.000 --> 32:07.120
I'll break my contract.

32:07.800 --> 32:10.200
I'll sell these goods to you.

32:10.800 --> 32:12.960
But the price remains the same.

32:14.240 --> 32:16.720
Seventy million cash in three days.

32:16.800 --> 32:18.280
Cash on delivery.

32:20.960 --> 32:23.200
If you can't pay me in three days,

32:23.720 --> 32:26.360
I'll sign a contract with them.

32:54.080 --> 32:56.120
They pretended.

32:57.680 --> 33:00.440
That man was foolish.

33:04.320 --> 33:06.040
If he had been ordered to smash my shop,

33:08.360 --> 33:09.560
he wouldn't have left so easily .

33:10.400 --> 33:11.320
Yunxiu.

33:11.840 --> 33:13.240
If I'm going out,

33:13.320 --> 33:14.480
I'll leave Yingtao with you.

33:15.240 --> 33:16.120
You should be careful.

33:17.480 --> 33:19.920
If he comes again, I won't let him go.

33:23.000 --> 33:23.840
Duanwu.

33:26.360 --> 33:27.720
If you're not in the shop,

33:28.320 --> 33:30.280
I'll guard it for you.

33:32.600 --> 33:34.600
I'm relieved to have you there.

33:37.160 --> 33:38.240
Well.

33:43.280 --> 33:46.800
These are the materials

33:46.880 --> 33:49.640
damaged in transit.

33:49.720 --> 33:51.640
It's a waste to throw them away.

33:51.720 --> 33:53.320
Can we use them?

34:01.280 --> 34:03.720
Look at this broken gold jewelry.

34:03.800 --> 34:06.040
We can smelt it,

34:06.120 --> 34:09.120
make a design,
and make it into new jewelry.

34:10.960 --> 34:13.920
We can take off the jewelry on it
and use it elsewhere.

34:14.520 --> 34:16.400
This one is slightly damaged.

34:16.480 --> 34:17.960
We can fix it.

34:18.600 --> 34:19.719
Look.

34:19.800 --> 34:21.000
Fill it…

34:31.679 --> 34:33.040
There must be a lot of girls in Yangzhou

34:33.760 --> 34:35.400
who have jewelry

34:36.560 --> 34:38.679
that needs to be repaired.

34:42.880 --> 34:44.400
We can

34:45.840 --> 34:49.320
recycle their old jewelry
and transform it.

34:51.600 --> 34:53.960
Yingtao, put out a new sign tomorrow

34:54.040 --> 34:58.120
saying that we recycle jewelry
and reinvent the style.

34:58.200 --> 34:59.880
By the way, buy some old jewelry.

34:59.960 --> 35:01.440
We can use it as a raw material.

35:01.520 --> 35:02.520
We can get through this.

35:03.680 --> 35:05.120
Will it work?

35:05.200 --> 35:06.640
Duanwu is always right.

35:07.760 --> 35:09.800
Okay, I'll make the sign tomorrow.

35:14.800 --> 35:15.920
Father.

35:17.200 --> 35:18.200
Si.

35:18.720 --> 35:21.200
It's late. We'll talk about it tomorrow.

35:22.000 --> 35:23.720
I heard that our treasure was ruined.

35:24.320 --> 35:26.480
I have an idea.

35:35.560 --> 35:36.760
Si.

35:36.840 --> 35:38.080
How did you know about that?

35:40.400 --> 35:41.880
Father. I heard

35:41.960 --> 35:44.160
you shut down a business
you had been running for a long time.

35:44.240 --> 35:45.560
I'm worried
that we have financial problems.

35:45.640 --> 35:47.360
In my opinion, we can ask others…

35:47.440 --> 35:49.200
-Si, don't talk nonsense.
-Come on in.

35:53.920 --> 35:54.920
Father.

35:55.960 --> 35:56.840
Yuqing.

35:57.520 --> 35:59.320
-Guard outside.
-Yes, sir.

36:10.080 --> 36:12.080
Why are you here again?
Do you want to smash our shop again?

36:12.680 --> 36:13.680
Yes.

36:14.680 --> 36:17.080
I'll smash this shop

36:17.160 --> 36:18.680
again.

36:18.760 --> 36:20.240
Who is that?

36:20.320 --> 36:21.680
I dare you

36:36.720 --> 36:37.840
to smash my shop.

36:39.000 --> 36:40.880
Put down the broom. Careful.

36:57.080 --> 36:58.280
Your broom.

37:04.120 --> 37:05.160
Duanwu.

37:05.760 --> 37:09.520
He is the number one martial arts master
in the world.

37:10.600 --> 37:11.800
He came to smash our shop again.

37:17.280 --> 37:18.640
You smashed my shop, right?

37:20.320 --> 37:22.640
Nice to meet you. Nice to meet you.

37:25.360 --> 37:26.680
Smash it.

37:28.120 --> 37:29.360
Well.

37:29.440 --> 37:31.840
Don't smash gift boxes today. Thank you.

37:40.200 --> 37:41.040
Smash it.

37:46.840 --> 37:47.680
Shou.

37:48.640 --> 37:50.360
Go out and close the door.

37:51.000 --> 37:53.680
I'll smash the shop

37:53.760 --> 37:55.240
again.

37:55.320 --> 37:56.520
Okay.

38:03.440 --> 38:06.280
I can't do this.

38:06.360 --> 38:08.000
It's not good to hit people.

38:08.080 --> 38:10.280
Are you going to make a living
from this for the rest of your life?

38:12.080 --> 38:14.040
You don't have a wife or children, right?

38:14.120 --> 38:16.080
My boss said

38:16.160 --> 38:18.480
a man must have ambition.

38:24.520 --> 38:26.520
Yingtao, I have a lot of work
to do back there.

38:26.600 --> 38:27.920
I'll get to work.

38:28.520 --> 38:29.560
I'll leave him to you.

38:30.320 --> 38:31.960
Okay, Yunxiu.

38:37.400 --> 38:39.400
-Miss.
-My name is Yingtao.

38:41.720 --> 38:42.920
Ms. Yingtao.

38:44.720 --> 38:46.080
To be honest,

38:46.160 --> 38:49.200
my cousin committed a crime.

38:49.280 --> 38:50.200
I need money urgently.

38:50.280 --> 38:52.160
But I don't have money.

38:53.120 --> 38:55.800
I had no choice but to agree with Mr. Qin

38:55.880 --> 38:57.200
to do this kind of thing.

38:57.720 --> 38:58.720
I…

39:01.760 --> 39:04.200
How about this?
You hang out on the streets.

39:04.280 --> 39:05.840
You must know a lot of news.

39:05.920 --> 39:07.640
Help us to find out

39:07.720 --> 39:09.400
who has jewelry that we don't want.

39:09.480 --> 39:10.760
I'll ask my boss to give you commission.

39:11.600 --> 39:12.880
Miss, what do you mean?

39:12.960 --> 39:13.920
You…

39:14.000 --> 39:15.280
Do you want me

39:16.480 --> 39:17.920
to become a good person?

39:18.000 --> 39:20.000
-I didn't mean it.
-Then…

39:20.840 --> 39:22.640
-Let's go.
-Where are we going?

39:22.720 --> 39:23.640
Smash the shop.

39:25.120 --> 39:26.240
Smash the shop?

39:26.320 --> 39:29.240
There is a lot of waste wood
in the backyard. You can smash it.

39:30.760 --> 39:32.560
Ms. Yingtao, it's not good.

39:34.240 --> 39:35.560
What do you tell your employer

39:35.640 --> 39:37.000
if you don't smash it?

39:51.440 --> 39:52.600
Yingtao.

39:57.040 --> 39:58.080
Yingtao.

39:59.800 --> 40:00.960
Yingtao.

40:02.600 --> 40:04.800
Lady Xue, you're here.

40:05.840 --> 40:07.920
What are you happy about?

40:08.000 --> 40:08.960
Tell me about it.

40:09.560 --> 40:10.640
Nothing.

40:10.720 --> 40:12.240
Are you here to buy jewelry?

40:12.320 --> 40:13.320
We have new ones.

40:16.680 --> 40:18.840
I looked at the jewelry

40:18.920 --> 40:20.480
I bought last time.

40:21.160 --> 40:22.400
It doesn't compliment my complexion.

40:24.600 --> 40:27.360
Do you want to return it?

40:28.880 --> 40:29.960
You can return it.

40:30.600 --> 40:32.080
Ms. Su told us

40:32.160 --> 40:34.520
that the songstresses
should wear the latest jewelry.

40:34.600 --> 40:36.920
If you don't like it anymore,
you can return it.

40:37.000 --> 40:38.440
We only charge a 30% depreciation fee.

40:39.560 --> 40:40.600
Thirty percent?

40:41.200 --> 40:42.720
That's too much.

40:43.320 --> 40:44.760
If I put the jewelry I wore

40:44.840 --> 40:47.840
in your shop, there would be
a lot of people rushing to buy it.

40:47.920 --> 40:49.320
You want to charge me a depreciation fee.

40:49.400 --> 40:51.240
If you think the depreciation fee
is too much,

40:51.320 --> 40:52.520
you can trade it for a new one.

40:52.600 --> 40:53.920
It's worth 80% of its price.

40:54.000 --> 40:55.680
In that way, you can buy new jewelry

40:55.760 --> 40:58.080
for very little money.

40:59.680 --> 41:01.880
Trade in old for new.

41:03.080 --> 41:04.440
It's a good deal.

41:10.920 --> 41:14.160
You mention Ms. Su in every sentence.

41:14.800 --> 41:17.600
Have you become an employee of Clear Mind?

41:18.440 --> 41:21.560
Lady Xue, I came to Clear Mind.

41:21.640 --> 41:23.640
I have to make a living from it.

41:23.720 --> 41:25.840
Do you want me to depend on you
for the rest of my life?

41:26.520 --> 41:29.040
All right. You're thinking about me.

41:30.880 --> 41:33.200
Take a 20% depreciation fee.

41:33.960 --> 41:35.080
Ten percent.

41:35.160 --> 41:36.880
Lady Xue, I can't.

41:36.960 --> 41:38.920
I think about you.

41:39.000 --> 41:40.880
But there are rules in the shop.

41:40.960 --> 41:42.520
I can't decide.

41:42.600 --> 41:43.880
How about this?

41:43.960 --> 41:46.080
If you have any outdated jewelry,

41:46.160 --> 41:47.400
you can trade it for a new one.

41:47.480 --> 41:50.320
But you need to promote Clear Mind
among the songstresses.

41:50.400 --> 41:51.880
With your reputation,

41:51.960 --> 41:53.280
everyone will respond to your call.

41:53.360 --> 41:55.120
If the price is good,

41:55.200 --> 41:56.040
we'll give you a commission.

41:58.520 --> 42:00.280
Yingtao.

42:00.360 --> 42:02.480
You're so right not to be a songstress.

42:03.800 --> 42:04.880
Forget it.

42:05.920 --> 42:08.280
I'll think of it
as supporting my own business.

42:09.600 --> 42:10.880
However.

42:13.360 --> 42:14.400
How much is the commission?

42:16.000 --> 42:17.640
It depends on the price.

42:21.040 --> 42:23.920
Okay. It's a good thing
to wear new jewelry.

42:25.360 --> 42:27.640
-I'll handle it.
-Thank you, Lady Xue.

42:28.400 --> 42:30.120
Show me the jewelry.

42:30.200 --> 42:31.640
Come here.

42:31.720 --> 42:33.920
These are new pieces of jewelry.
